  id: vessel_roots
  displayName: Grasping Roots
  description: 'Stamp the floor and the Vessel''s roots burst up in a line toward your aim. Every foe they catch is held fast and left Bound for two seconds - even the great ones, who cannot be held but cannot shake the roots. The Vessel mantras are bound together: they take all three sockets.'
