  cooldown: 9
  unlockedAtStart: 0
  setId: vessel
  setSlot: 0
  setName: Mantras of the Vessel
  setDescription: 'What slept in the vault is broken, and its hunger now answers to you. Grasping Roots, Hand of the Vessel and Requiem Wail come as one and take all three sockets: drag the dead in, bind them and crush them - but they give you no shield.'
